    Note over Client: ✓ Execution: 100 shares @ $149.50
    Note over Client: ✓ Trade settled at: 14:30:27 (T+2 from 14:30:25)
    Note over Client: ✓ Cash deducted: $14,950.00 + $50 fee = $15,000.00
    Note over Client: ✓ Shares in portfolio: 100 @ avg cost $150.00
